{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37809","headline":"题兴善寺 · 郑谷","name":"题兴善寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寺在帝城阴，清虚胜二林。\n藓侵隋画暗，茶助越瓯深。\n巢鹤和钟唳，诗僧倚锡吟。\n烟莎後池水，前迹杳难寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}